{"availability":"available","full":"awasthiprashast/microaggregation-income-tax","name":"microaggregation-income-tax","description":"Micro-aggregation (MDAV) for privacy-preserving publication of income and tax microdata, with a Streamlit dashboard","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-05T07:03:43Z","updated":"2026-10-10T00:28:42Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://microaggregation-income-tax.streamlit.app/","topics":["data-cleaning","data-privacy","data-validation","income-tax","k-anonymity","mdav","microaggregation","privacy-preserving","python","streamlit","t-closeness"],"demo":"https://microaggregation-income-tax.streamlit.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:40.600Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:40.600Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:40.600Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T08:00:40.600Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A complete, reproducible data-privacy project showing how micro-aggregation (MDAV) can protect sensitive financial records in an income/tax microdata release while preserving statistical utility — and, just as importantly, where it falls short. It includes the algorithm, a release guard, a battery of utility and attack metrics, an interactive Streamlit dashboard and a full report.","Important: micro-aggregation reduces disclosure risk; it does not make data absolutely anonymous. Attribute-disclosure and background-knowledge attacks remain possible and are measured explicitly in this project (see Limitations)."],"features":["MDAV micro-aggregation from scratch (NumPy), k-anonymous on all released attributes, means and total tax revenue preserved exactly.","Two baselines: individual ranking and random partition, to make the privacy–utility trade-off visible.","Release guard: whitelisted columns, shuffled rows, fresh ids, enforced k-anonymity — unsafe releases cannot be exported.","Attack suite: record linkage, interval disclosure, homogeneity / l-diversity / t-closeness, dominance and p%-rules, QI-inference, collusion.","Safe-by-default dashboard: exact original values are hidden unless a custodian toggle is switched on."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/awasthiprashast/microaggregation-income-tax/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1776cb1d691e2b2ce6211ebfa18c65c7fb62eaa6242f5a45d4a16133ecb056f2","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:40.707Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:40.707Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A complete, reproducible data-privacy project showing how micro-aggregation (MDAV) can protect sensitive financial records in an income/tax microdata release while preserving statistical utility — and, just as importantly, where it falls short. It includes the algorithm, a release guard, a battery of utility and attack metrics, an interactive Streamlit dashboard and a full report.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/awasthiprashast/microaggregation-income-tax/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"1776cb1d691e2b2ce6211ebfa18c65c7fb62eaa6242f5a45d4a16133ecb056f2","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/awasthiprashast/microaggregation-income-tax/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:40.707Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T00:28:42Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/awasthiprashast/microaggregation-income-tax/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:40.708Z","hash":"1776cb1d691e2b2ce6211ebfa18c65c7fb62eaa6242f5a45d4a16133ecb056f2","originalBytes":10798,"storedBytes":10798,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["docs","data","results","income","report","tax","mdav","utility","dashboard","privacy","project","python","released","figures","release","run","synthetic","tests","attributes","bash","confidential","disclosure","export","microagg","partition","records","report.md","screenshots","clean","import","individual","k-anony